sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Gerrit as Gerrit Code Review
    participant Zuul as Zuul System
    participant Nodes as Nodes (Infra)
    participant Job as Job Executor
    participant Secret as Secrets Store (Internal)
    participant Artifact as Artifact Store (Zuul)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. CHECK PIPELINE (Verification)
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(235, 245, 251)
        Note right of Dev: 1. CHECK Pipeline (On PR Creation)
        
        Dev->>Gerrit: git push (Modify: playbooks/grafana/...)
        Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Patchset Created
        
        Note right of Zuul: Loads 'zuul.d/project.yaml'<br/>Evaluates 'check' pipeline

        par Resource & Config Eval
            Zuul->>Nodes: Request Node (ubuntu/centos) Based on nodesets.yaml
            Nodes-->>Zuul: Assign Fresh Node
        and Job Selection Logic
            Note right of Zuul: Filter jobs (Match: playbooks/grafana, roles/build-wheel-cache, etc.)
        end

        %% [Always Run Group]
        %% Registry
        Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] opendev-buildset-registry
        Note right of Job: Setup Registry (Runs even if not used!)

        %% Linters
        Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] openstack-zuul-jobs-linters
        Job->>Job: Exec: tox -e linters

        %% Integration
        Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] openstack-infra-extra-integration-noble
        Job->>Job: Exec: tests/extra.yaml

        %% RPM Build (Check phase)
        Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] openafs-rpm-package-build-*

        %% [Conditional Run]
        opt If 'playbooks/grafana/**' changed
            Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] project-config-grafana
            Job->>Job: Docker Run (Uses the Registry)
            Job->>Job: Exec: playbooks/grafana/main.yaml
        end
        
        opt If 'playbooks/wheel-cache/**' changed
            Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] build-wheel-cache-*
            Note right of Job: (Ignores Registry)
        end

        %% POST-RUN (청소 및 로그 수집)
        rect rgb(238, 238, 238)
            Note right of Zuul: 🧹 Automatic Post-Run
            Job->>Artifact: Upload Logs (console.log, syslog)
            Zuul->>Nodes: Delete/Return Nodes (Cleanup)
            Note right of Zuul: Resources released regardless of Success/Fail
        end

        alt ❌ Check Failed (Verified -1)
            Job--xZuul: One or more Jobs Failed
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Vote: Verified -1
            Note right of Dev: Action: Check Logs & Fix code
        else ✅ Check Passed (Verified +1)
            Job-->>Zuul: All Jobs Succeeded
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Vote: Verified +1
            Note right of Dev: Action: Wait for Review
        end
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. HUMAN REVIEW & VOTING SCENARIOS
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(255, 253, 231)
        Note right of Dev: 2. HUMAN REVIEW (Voting Decisions)

        alt 🚫 Vote -1 or -2 (Reject)
            Dev->>Gerrit: Vote Code-Review -1/-2
            Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Code-Review -1/-2
            Note right of Zuul: Action: None (Gate Not Triggered)
            
        else ⏳ Vote +1 (LGTM)
            Dev->>Gerrit: Vote Code-Review +1
            Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Code-Review +1
            Note right of Zuul: Action: None (Wait for Core Approval)
            
        else 🚀 Vote +2 (Core Approved)
            Dev->>Gerrit: Vote Code-Review +2
            Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Code-Review +2
            Note right of Zuul: Action: Trigger GATE Pipeline
        end
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 3. GATE PIPELINE EXECUTION
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(220, 237, 200)
        Note right of Zuul: 3. GATE Pipeline (Triggered only by +2)
        
        Zuul->>Nodes: Request Clean Nodes

        %% Gate 단계에서 생성된 결과물(RPM/Deb)은 Zuul Artifact로 저장됨
        critical Critical Tests & Build
            Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] openafs-rpm-package-build-*
            
            %% [Release 서명 추가] RPM 서명을 위해 비밀 키 호출
            rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
                Job->>Secret: Fetch 'RPM_SIGNING_KEY'
                Secret-->>Job: Provide Key (Temporary)
            end
            
            Job->>Job: Exec: run.yaml (Build & Sign RPMs)
            Job-->>Artifact: Upload Built RPMs (Artifacts)
            Note right of Job: Artifacts saved for Promote phase
        end
        
        %% POST-RUN (Gate 단계도 동일하게 청소)
        rect rgb(238, 238, 238)
            Note right of Zuul: 🧹 Automatic Post-Run
            Job->>Artifact: Upload Logs
            Zuul->>Nodes: Delete/Return Nodes
        end

        alt ❌ Gate Failed
            Job--xZuul: Job Failed
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Vote: Verified -1 (Merge Rejected)
            Note right of Zuul: Merge Canceled
        else ✅ Gate Passed
            Job-->>Zuul: Job Succeeded
            Zuul->>Gerrit: Submit (Merge Request)
            Note right of Zuul: Merged to Master
        end
    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 4. PROMOTE PIPELINE
    %% ==========================================
    rect rgb(253, 235, 208)
        Note right of Dev: 4. PROMOTE Pipeline (Post-Merge)
        
        Gerrit->>Zuul: Event: Ref-Updated (Merged)
        
        par Promote Actions
            opt RPM Package Promote
                Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] openafs-rpm-package-build-promote
                
                Job->>Artifact: Download Artifacts (from Gate job)
                Artifact-->>Job: openafs-rpms.tar.gz
                
                Job->>Job: Exec: publish.yaml (Extract & Move)
                Note right of Job: Publish to AFS/Repo (Not PPA)
            end

            opt Docs Promote
                Zuul->>Job: [Trigger] publish-tox-docs-infra
                Job->>Job: Build Sphinx Docs
                Job->>Job: Publish to docs.openstack.org
            end
        end
    end
    
    Zuul-->>Dev: Pipeline Complete
